        "id": 191559,
        "name": "neoadvent89",
        "username": "neoadvent89",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/neoadvent89/{size}/1913_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-03-09T00:10:42.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Got a near mint, gave myself plenty of time to setup heroes and heal some before flipping the dreamer. Used parse to control dreamers deck, CR to kill projections out of turn with ultimate target, and medico for being and idealist to reduce damage the dreamer was dishing out.</p>",
