      {
        "id": 191560,
        "name": "KateWalker",
        "username": "TakeWalker",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-03-09T00:33:44.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Following the general suggestions above, I got a Near Mint, but it wasn't exactly easy. Chrono-Ranger had the highest HP with 8. But all that build-up meant I didn't lose my important stuff during the flip (or afterward to certain Projections), Chrono always had lots of damage to deal thanks to Parse, and the end of the game came a bit quicker than I realized. In fact, most of it was just using Syntactic Analysis on the Sentinels and seeing how much healing Dr. Medico could dish out. So yeah, slow and steady wins this race, and I never would have considered that without the help of the cool folks on this board. Thanks, guys! :)</p>",
