        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/278dde/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2017-03-09T15:10:50.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Bigbywolfe\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/dbc845/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Bigbywolfe:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Finally succeeded on my 4th or 5th attempt with Writhe unconscious and everyone else in single digits.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Ditto. Writhe out, everyone else under 5.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Fine.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Whew. This one played out as the 11-year old girl repeatedly slapping the 6-year old girl in the face to wake her up. And sometimes Neuro-Toxins were administered–but the Doctor was on hand to make sure she didn't slip away…</p>",
